  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Comparing the equation of the parabola, with standard equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></math>, we get&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math>.</p><p>Figure is drawn on the basis of the given information.</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0082_7e778a273cad.png\" style=\"width: 307px; height: 264px;\" /></p><p>Parametric form of parabola is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Equation of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>N</mi><mi>Q</mi></math>:&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mstyle></mfrac></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>i.e.,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#183;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>t</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>M</mi><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>9</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>&nbsp;</p>"
  }
